{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1509,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7ff581b87ad28ceb082a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒啊啊啊啊！……呼。宝穴前辈\n说过，大声喊出来就会很有干劲！\n好，心满意足该回去啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffe015d4ec255faa90184dad9d28edb937b6b4681c88c6d6b5c05542aed4841f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59c1015188121c5571ee84f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好好给努力的潘多拉\n准备奖励吗？冰淇淋~果汁~\n……还有一星期的假期♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a2816f14de16e3915add0029746a81c1d988b309d8f99709a6da5ba787af5d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5a30824cf3f23caf83d0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是按你说的试了一下，\n用时就变少了……\n呐！难道说……你也是天才？",
      "source_fingerprint": "085abff40d44a3ae7b5939940bab1f081d4d40342085663ef60e7436342c28a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec2be75dadad86e3a15b007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，如果是你和我的话，\n总会有办法的♪\n毕竟，我们可是天才啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455e89c0844867dc9084a468e34365b4dcf117c742dd19aaec84e7e8f1121813",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e866720af0347bfc4f1f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最信赖你的人绝~对是我！！\n……怎么~？\n害羞了吗？害羞了吗~~？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfffb539f58767f1a452a667cc2ba8596c57e5bb1c44416cc6368fb70c26ba88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0edcc3dff64c3075e53a70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿！我也好，你也好，都是天才☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da9a0ac10da107404c7d8ff297536a98c808f49322e6ed85ae8454cb0695407c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d00d824ca09258c7c5c895f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看！很天才吧？♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "acdad64a6ef5d1c180b4b23dd9b89aa39d46774c03d5601ed37702b95dc22da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d5ad305ecaa1d90cfb49da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么闪闪发光的回忆，不会忘记的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6bac149ab2be5afa4a79f0291e49be839c0b0996d515ea641ab3a08b801a95d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1a7c89bf8febdb849020e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是超努力的~一起去度假吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78865704e90e2581da95d2921a2de2b8978b1f92a265484078575da64fe7c830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a81515e65ea1bbe57b3543",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让订阅人数猛增起来吧♪ 然后，\n拿到很多奖励，还会被狠狠夸奖哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a6e4d15b5419dd5baba5af1a8a98b34abb994dce1f5c883dbb52f2bce15f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec00370362325fb13ebfa4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等看完全部视频，就去要奖励好了♡\n找爸爸撒娇庆功宴要在高级餐厅\n举办！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb32556b0c9b60bb3c2761537a42df7f30329c0603443f12824b5c5f085af04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df921bfc3177abf172bb0c68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿！夸夸我也可以的哦~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7499d069b1fe26a23a6b1fd6963f7b1c9365110d0e738289b22f41ac3db3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83bf09ce6cc97b8064965067",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我果然是天才……♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbe96e6647a87a95072693f4cce19bd55cb05029240c7c79222905e30333cd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9982f8f9fafd792f7bc6311",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来~啦！超绝天才少女♡\n房一潘多拉登场♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbffc1b8314381e41a0df8f6788a27ba65470951a34c50250b7d80409524bd47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe9823afb6f3c71145802f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛—嘛—，我可是天才♡\n传说，就让我来创造吧，我说真的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12b3c331c9af11205c6ffd2753e06a91f6a6afd05dc6b9c075055f3a56abe6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b3a5bc6b28c35203365008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢，不愧是我~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f259114cd99c6d69e303957054cde6a748ec092631da71086f01bdb4de2c6f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4271af8c292c998ef68e6a78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我果然很有才能嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ad50625b671fa673ce7bf8b120620e8ea62737451c9b1827fea635df67930d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:560861cd907cb53bc30e9da3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超~开阔的感觉♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "144e27ebcd5bdb20254d2a770d743bc838cf00470536a36f3b8e5756e12131f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b653d2259b9965e95811a863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限这种东西~我都不知道哦！♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "490e18247b6e69236f7d6734ea50eafeeaa7f205c66662085dc7d741a80a0b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f3819d7bee47ab8e2f4e5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇往直前天才少女，降临♪\n太耀眼了真是抱歉♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "905edfb3ae483199aa2f6c9072e7b5cd7131535baf303b48c89f2ef0e622ada6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff35e3e708b7b3c33c31f83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是房一潘多拉~♡\n是要去度假吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1689d1a7c1c83d9c323d7144aae9d4e1b2f0f9bdafa71b9059a7cedbf350b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69f271d92d5f873c3250714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27034d160af1c1f09dc5bc82dd514313c27a89258641f741350dfcc49d329de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:911365fe3c91eabd3d7b8c8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当时听到你说临时签约虽然吃惊\n……但反倒安心了一些。\n这表示，你有在认真对待梦想呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "067455c1106c7d6d93148a0ec6f538962ab99835d1eeef38364cdc26ef72a89f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3ddb04a6aaa492cb9f8207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf63e4df3be11e4696ce76c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e21595815d4a91e87bd541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "叫你训练员的时候，\n心里还是会有些扑通扑通跳呢。\n不过我想，过阵子就习惯了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca0cb8ab9b34fc87a7c59a7b8c2a758cd18825fff52ab041c987b9dcac45dc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f625558bd50dd9c6c69da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起看烟花时，\n眼前的景色也会变得不同吧。\n……一定会映照出更璀璨的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6ab443e638c576f8bbdb4eddb9ae043d8b882e87076dcd54598f2a2677688f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a1fd3633857eefa6ed247b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈送来的年糕，\n我会做成杂煮带过去的！\n已经能再现出家里的味道了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5414347b502e8b4d50607f3e61101038dcc5703731c69c6e18a1169d246da209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f36d956ebb1e4f553920e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪ 我家……\n还有你家送来的东西都在我这里，\n等下就交给你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b7bedeea8dcd0341fdd104e389ca31cf704c8e0b75338b6aaf380e2ead0681",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d207b03135d9aeb82d7343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力先留个悬念……♪\n做得比去年更符合哥哥的口味了，\n敬请期待哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "001844c778750de61ceaadc930a07efcac350e194a40204758c0e4bc7adc4432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df730129cb21792caf9edbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "织女牛郎……\n希望他们今年也能重逢\n天各一方实在太让人寂寞了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "463a1775ae25e1b71867580d67838ce828e2d4d7d5141fca74eb82c67492c3ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:699960f443906b61b379b564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节装饰，有些恐怖呢。\n……啊，不过我不会再哭鼻子了哦！\n……真・的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1deeee960ac69cb22630940e3a3d1b4616e48cc71fe62200be0e9fea29e6f165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166cd76beecde1b352b63828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏闪耀同学帮忙，终于会做\n史多伦蛋糕了。搞不好还能再现\n住在德国的奶奶那份味道♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "410560724da0e71076f6b0bbe0bee8db706810feb7a7ae5c464f05a175c7a1a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc8c40a4da65ec0430bf473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然够不上圣诞大餐……\n但我会亲手做出心意和味道\n都不输大餐的料理哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f048e08b69349b6273a01c86128902d1ac802b82ef16d48bf5c4d71645e721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a842e1d0452ca4429e858a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们做到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf84e52237d543f1482f3064a49adeaf773b406d4c1d836c7a093bf7a3c982ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6689671f73ee6f7705600653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "除夕会在家里过年啊。那样的话，\n我大概傍晚送年菜过去可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34edc7c777d520860a589ed8aceb84d29595e088a02917bff160310e22e8e7b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc924badce35ca1e0d8435f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日蛋糕啊礼物啊……还有很多哦！\n要把分开时错过的都补回来\n好好庆祝一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41abc624a5b30412852b56a00815ea8032463b9d3210a210f0c62810f72ef917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0337116cf4d72263bc6efd75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又长大一岁了呢。看来是要变成\n越来越可靠的哥哥了吧……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b753629bba9cef01ee12bec4353887e8930e03c7f4dee5f914168027865ad4ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e127f7c52f5d711172ad5044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你每年都为我庆祝。\n只要听到你的话语，\n就觉得这一年又能继续努力了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390923a6b7532dfa7b72d2b516e08a758c9aca8bcff552ccc359bb500296d1b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa69bc13b8999d83fa511589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日想要什么？那、那就……\n今天一天，让我独占哥哥吧！\n……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "291c6de602b82bc9f293d5cd504a068355c77882aa0c95747799bc56cb90f4c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b335c5f9c04f2d06c0a6338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到好消息了吗？\n会是什么呢，好期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e9b9afd2b28be7a41945e4c5786dfafcdc6915bc2bb7200cec011b0d0feaac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4164be937d080566bace661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了呢。\n我也来帮忙搭把手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "199b8beff049e572944a9cd4993d64e9d28a3e66241ed40eceb90486612db318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fdba47f5930f5b2a93d7129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成！\n还是老样子，很可靠呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea1eae5501f9a739088b0ebb5233d9086eb9b2b4124a9ea7509290488ce1dd5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b85f62e42ab0c35d222072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家好像都在忙着为活动做准备\n……有什么我能帮忙的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a343a388746a85311ac4886c1a403f4be2351e983e61cd9c68463e7397b4f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2ee474fcc5a3f545f56969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办的活动看起来好热闹……！\n等忙完工作，一起去逛逛怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dbfef4898c7a429feb7deba4e8811166751a2874c2308628d444dcbdae5bbc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54eaaca519f9e94ab78b8758",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会再输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80307691efe6aac30b1547e300e3b6826c1f5ff0fa73eaba57784c4e89f02b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b28065d18a60aed3750c96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级上升了哦！\n一直都很努力呢……\n我也很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b6e0bfc8062dbca0c660e9e07551f77da0518f318f961c03582be3c2747b90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c19d5a69ebd49fd38314151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想多穿穿成熟稳重的衣服呢……\n因为有着想并肩前行的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecff941d7e5eb69af103c115f889e3045cf2e5fc8f3f5a44c86ddd96157a2e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:189a5427a054b5a0413d22c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一看到有缎带的衣服，\n就忍不住要买呢。\n实在太可爱了……根本抵抗不住~",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b20402a5ef54ab2339dbae416bec996a577a4fcd2704958d487597da9a99c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7554d25759e2df2ab4ee58a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小特前辈出门时\n居然双双迷路了……\n呜~这路痴属性真想好好治治……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0344d0dc2309c7558fe3c5232cf4ab39bba97e204493b862521f0c8bd726d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b823d13531f76edbf13b769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还想对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad87f37de39915525d2b71689443d936605b840bc1a39c32850694c7a109dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
